 "Mitokondriyal elektron taşıma zincirinde Kompleks I (NADH dehidrojenaz) enzimini inhibe ederek hücresel enerji (ATP) üretimini durdurur. Ani ve güçlü kontakt etkilidir": "Stops cellular energy (ATP) production by inhibiting the Complex I (NADH dehydrogenase) enzyme in the mitochondrial electron transport chain. Fast and strong contact action",
